   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Soft neutral editorial: median ~140, neutral shadows (36,34,28), neutral-cool highlights (220,216,216), low-medium saturation (0.22), natural skin (hue 30). Best for: Editorial and fashion-led wedding frames, black-tie receptions, architectural venues, monochrome outfits. Neutral base that lets decor colours speak quietly.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
